# DaVinci Resolve MCP — Cursor rules

## Central documentation (read first)

Fleet **2026** standards live in **MCP Central Docs** (local clone):

`D:\Dev\repos\mcp-central-docs\`

**Hub:** `standards\AGENT_PROTOCOLS.md` — links to all modular standards.

**Most relevant for this repo:**

- `standards\SOTA_REQUIREMENTS.md` — FastMCP **3.1+** (prompts, resources, `ctx.sample()`, skills provider)
- `standards\TOOL_DESIGN_STANDARDS.md` — portmanteau tools, docstrings, args
- `standards\WEBAPP_STANDARDS.md` — dashboard rules; ports **10700–10800**; this project **10842** / **10843**
- `operations\WEBAPP_PORTS.md` — port registry
- `standards\PACKAGING_STANDARDS.md` — uv, justfile, `llms.txt` + `llms-full.txt`, glama, MCPB
- `standards\CODE_QUALITY_STANDARDS.md` — Ruff, pre-commit, optional `ty`

## Shell (Windows)

PowerShell: use `;` to chain commands; avoid bash-only syntax in scripts.
